      "writtenOn": "2020-11-25T20:12:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically the CLC specify the class loader structure/hierarchy that the app is expected to have at runtime. This includes the libraries, but may also include additional apk (like split apks, or anything that gets added by the app dynamically). The tree of libraries is only a part of the CLC. I think it\u0027s ok to focus on the library part here, but worth updating with a note that other things may be in.",
